data: {"id": "5ca86d73b1e946ae-final", "run_id": "5ca86d73b1e946ae", "seq": 1165, "ts_ms": 1789133737335, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-v08/workload` | CrashLoopBackOff | Pod aiops-case-v08/workload 处于 CrashLoopBackOff 状态，无法正常运行 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | kubelet | `Back-off restarting failed container app in pod workload_aiops-case-v08(00e5e755-886e-4661-9e8a-00d1e71595f6)` | 确认容器持续重启并被调度器强制 BackOff 的现场状态 |\n| 2 | K8s State | container | `last_terminated_reason`: Error, `last_exit_code`: 127 | 确认容器以 127 异常码终止，这是命令或文件缺失的典型特征 |\n| 3 | K8s Config | pod spec | `resource_request.memory`: 8Mi, `resource_limit.memory`: 32Mi | 资源请求极低，排除 OOMKill（OOMKill 通常退出码为 137），将根因指向应用逻辑 |\n| 4 | Logging | elasticsearch | `sh: exec: line 0: /opt/app/unavailable-command: not found` | **决定性证据**：直接指出容器主进程执行 `/opt/app/unavailable-command` 失败 |\n| 5 | K8s Event | pod | `Reason: CrashLoopBackOff` | 关联日志与事件，确立因启动命令缺失导致的循环重启现象 |\n\n**证据互证说明**：\n日志事实 (#4) 提供了容器启动失败的具体技术细节，解释了为何退出码为 127 (#2)。极低的内存限制 (#3) 与 127 退出码共同排除了资源耗尽（如 OOM）的可能性，确立了根因为“命令文件/二进制缺失”。事件 (#1, #5) 证实了这一单次失败演变为集群级持久性故障（CrashLoopBackOff）的结果。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n```text\n容器镜像中缺失入口命令 /opt/app/unavailable-command → 容器主进程执行 sh -c exec 失败 (Exit Code 127) → Kubernetes 检测到容器持续重启并进入 BackOff 策略 → Pod 状态显示为 CrashLoopBackOff\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n**已确认的根因**：\nPod `aiops-case-v08/workload` 中的 `app` 容器主进程启动失败。\n根据 Elasticsearch 日志事实，容器尝试执行的命令 `/opt/app/unavailable-command` 在镜像中不存在 (`not found`)，导致 Shell 以退出码 127 报错。这一启动失败引发了 Kubelet 的持续重启尝试，最终因重启频率过高而触发 `BackOff` 状态。\n\n支持该结论的关键事实：\n1. 日志明确提示目标命令未找到 (logging fact)。\n2. 容器终止状态为 Error 且退出码为 127 (kubernetes state fact)。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 53.8s\n├─ 问题定位: 19.7s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 24.7s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-v08/workload: 24.7s (Evidence 17.7s, RCA 6.8s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 9.4s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-v08/workload**: pod-crashloop-runtime\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 53.825, "metrics": {"run_id": "5ca86d73b1e946ae", "mttr": {"value": "53.8s", "seconds": 53.83115792274475, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "42%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-crashloop-runtime", "pass": true, "score": 0.9333, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.6666666666666666, "weighted_score": 0.1333}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-crashloop-runtime"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 53831.15792274475, "llm_calls": 12, "llm_duration_ms": 51319.825887680054, "tool_calls": 9, "executed_tool_calls": 7, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 2, "successful_tool_calls": 9, "failed_tool_calls": 0, "tool_duration_ms": 4909.013509750366, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 2132.779598236084}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 19717.878341674805, "su